blocks the e-pawn. Only a draw now.} 1... Ke8 {[%cal Rd6c7]} 2. Ke6 {[%also e4]
Ke6! — Take the opposition. e4 wins just as fast.} 2... Kf8 3. e4 Kg7 4. e5 Kg6
5. Kd7 Kf5 {[%cal Rd7d8,Rd7e8,Rd7e7]} 6. e6 {e6! — Your king protects the
e-pawn.} 6... Ke4 7. e7 Ke5 8. e8=Q+ {Queen! Your king protects the new queen,
