[LineName "02. How to take the opposition (9/15)"]
[LineDescription "Keeping the opposition is part of taking it."]

{Pawn on d4. Black moves first; then win. When the kings face each other, who
should be to move?} 1... Kc7 {[%cal Rb5a6,Rb5a5,Rd4d5]} 2. Kc5 {Kc5! — Take the
