2... Kd7 {[%cal Rc5b6,Rc5b5,Rd4d5]} 3. Kd5 {Kd5! — Take the opposition again.}
3... Kc7 4. Ke6 Kc6 {[%cal Re6e7,Re6f7,Re6f6]} 5. d5+ {d5+! — Your king protects
the d-pawn.} 5... Kc5 {[%cal Re6d7,Re6e7,Re6f7]} 6. d6 {d6! — Your king keeps
the d-pawn protected.} 6... Kc6 {[%cal Re6f7,Re6f6]} 7. d7 {[%also Ke7]} 7...
Kc7 {[%cal Rd7d8]} 8. Ke7 Kc6 9. d8=Q {Queen! Your king protects the new queen,
and the win is easy now.} *

