1... Kc8 2. Ke7 Kb7 3. d5 Kb6 4. d6 {d6! — Your king protects the d-pawn.} 4...
Kc5 5. d7 {d7! — The d-pawn runs: the king cannot catch it.} 5... Kd4 6. d8=Q+
{Queen! Your king protects the new queen, and the win is easy now.} *

