[LineName "07. Long lines (5/10)"]
[LineDescription "A long defence: the opposition held all the way."]

{Black's pawn is on c7. You are White: hold the draw.} 1. Kg5 {Kg5! — Take the
opposition. Kg4? — Black gets the opposition. Now Black wins.} 1... Kf7 2. Kf5
{Kf5! — Take the opposition again.} 2... Ke7 3. Ke5 {Ke5! — Take the opposition
again.} 3... Kd7 4. Kd5 c5 5. Kxc5 {[%also Kc4,Ke4] Draw! You take the pawn, and
bare kings cannot win.} *

